==In the manga==
===Pokémon Adventures===
[[File:Beck Adventures.png|thumb|200px|A male Veteran in Pokémon Adventures]]
====History====
====={{MangaArc|Platinum}}===== 
A male Veteran appeared as a background character in ''[[PS418|Deprogramming Porygon-Z]]'', where he was part of a group of people who entered the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|IV}} after [[Palmer]] had his assistants open the gates.

A male Veteran named '''Beck''' (Japanese: '''ベック''') appeared in ''[[PS422|Interrupting Ivysaur]]'' as one of {{adv|Platinum}}'s challengers at the [[Battle Arcade]]. Platinum managed to defeat him without losing any of her Pokémon.

====={{MangaArc|Black & White}}=====
A male and female Veteran were seen in ''[[PS489|Drawing Bridges]]'', where they were among the Trainers waiting to get to cross the [[Driftveil Drawbridge]].

A female Veteran with a {{p|Whimsicott}} was seen amongst the Trainers entering {{OBP|Victory Road|Black and White}} in ''[[PS511|Dream a Little Dream]]''.

====={{MangaArc|X & Y}}=====
In ''[[PS593|Xerneas Gives]]'', a male Veteran appeared at [[Lumiose City]].

